ling Gameplay where player moves across various levels, shooting enemies and avoiding obstacles.<br>3. Weapons: The game features a variety of weapons that player can pick up, such as the Machine Gun, Spread gun, Rotating Bullet gun, each with its own characteristics and advantages.<br>4. Diverse Levels: The game offers a range of diverse levels, each with different environments, challenges, and enemies. All levels are hand drawn to create a pixelated retro environment. <br>5. Boss Battles: At the end of each level, players encounter a challenging boss battle with each of Mogambo's associate. In the final level Players will have to beat Mogambo to rescue the Island.",
